### 7. Get all staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff

### 8. Get one staff (replace with a real id from a previous response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### 9. Update staff (JSON — PATCH, no photo support here)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/staff/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nino Updated",
  "roles": ["stylist", "colorist", "makeup"]
}

### 10. Delete staff
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/staff/REPLACE_WITH_ID


### =========================================================
### BOOKING
### Replace REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_ID with a real staff _id (from #7/#8 above)
### and REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID with the bookingId returned by #11/#12.
### The mock SMS logs the OTP to the server console — read it there.
### =========================================================

### 11. Request a slot — happy path (30 min, tomorrow 2pm)
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staffId": "6a8c779ee669090fba2968de",
  "startTime": "2026-08-25T14:00:00.000Z",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "customerPhone": "+995555123456",
  "customerName": "Giorgi"
}

### 12. Request a second, non-overlapping slot for the same staff
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staffId": "6a8c779ee669090fba2968de",
  "startTime": "2026-08-25T15:00:00.000Z",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "customerPhone": "+995555987654",
  "customerName": "Ana"
}

