### 25. Expired OTP flow — request a slot, wait 5+ minutes without
### verifying, then try to verify it. Should return 410 Gone and the
### slot should become bookable again (retry #11 with the same times).
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staffId": "REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_ID",
  "startTime": "2026-08-25T18:00:00.000Z",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "customerPhone": "+995555333444",
  "customerName": "ExpiryTest"
}

### 26. ...then after 5+ min, try verifying it (any 6-digit code) → 410 Gone
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 27. Too many wrong attempts (run 5x with wrong code, then a 6th
### attempt — even with the right code — should be 410 Gone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/booking/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID",
  "otp": "999999"
}